<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria's weekly forex demand rises to $86.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Nigeria's weekly forex demand rises to $86.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigeria's central bank said on Friday it sold $86.3 million at a rate of 80 neira to the dollar at its weekly auction this week.</p>
<p>Last week the bank sold $83.5 million at the same rate.</p>
<p>It gave no reason for the rise in demand but bankers attributed it to rising economic activities.</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
